# SHOWSTOPPER: the palace's bosses. Old Wicks blinks from place to place
# (shots pass through him as he fades), lays eggs that hatch into hopping
# skulls, and his crypt's four torches keep sending out roaming fire. The
# Ribbon slithers about: only its head is hurt, its body stops shots, its
# tail leaves slime that hurts, and its head fires rings. Morrow the
# Marvellous streams shots from his hat, fires a ring of stars with no
# gaps (dash through it), lets out bats, and splits into two that fire
# together from the sides.
game showstopper
wait 5
cheat run
cheat stage 4
cheat god
cheat cam 1952
cheat arena
cheat pos 152 2072
cheat boss 5 152 1992
expect boss_hp == 180
wait 90
waituntil kind_28 == 2 200
waituntil kind_27 >= 1 200
waituntil kind_29 >= 1 200
waituntil part0_a != 0 200
cheat killboss
wait 100
expect kind_27 == 0
# the Ribbon
cheat cam 976
cheat arena
cheat pos 152 1106
cheat boss 6 152 1016
expect boss_hp == 170
wait 100
waituntil hz_1 >= 1 60
cheat bosst 224
wait 2
expect eb_0 == 8
cheat killboss
wait 100
# Morrow
cheat cam 0
cheat arena
cheat nobullets
cheat pos 152 140
cheat boss 7 152 40
expect boss_hp == 340
wait 90
cheat bossphase 1 39
wait 2
expect eb_1 == 56
cheat nobullets
cheat bossphase 2 0
wait 40
expect kind_30 >= 3
cheat clear
cheat bossphase 3 0
wait 80
expect part1_alive == 1
expect part0_x < 70
expect part1_x > 250
